==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈfɔː(ɹ)ˌɡɹaʊnd/}}
* {{audio|En-us-foreground.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The elements of an image which lie closest to the [[picture plane]].
# The subject of an image, often depicted at the bottom in a [[two-dimensional]] work.
# {{context|computing|lang=en}} the [[application]] the user is currently interacting with; the application window that appears in front of all others.

====Related terms====
* [[background]]
* [[midground]]

